      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO SECOND CHANCE (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Lots Of Fun (23.43) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can find winning form. CRY TO ME (4) was in the minors two back (18.85) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. One of the better chances. WAKE UP SHADOW (5) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (18.77) in a Maiden at Richmond. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Can do much better this time. DEVON ON SAUCE (6) placed here at this trip last start - cannot be ignored.",
